Is the following email safe or phishing??

Date: Thu, 07 Aug 2008 09:20:33 +0000

Sender: Zefram <hzyoze@fysh.org>

Receiver: Chaddaï Fouché <pxgjidn.gktoib@gmail.com>

Email Subject: Re: IO::Pipe::End DESTROY? Shouldn't close() be called?

Email Body: Chaddaï Fouché wrote:
sub DESTROY {
   my $fh  shift;
   $fh-close() if $fh-opened();
}

If you're going to do that, make it:

sub DESTROY {
   local($., $@, $!, $^E, $?);
   my $fh  shift;
   $fh-close() if $fh-opened();
}

to avoid clobbering global status variables during unwinding.

-zefram

